SUMMARY:THE HARMONY GUYS
DESCRIPTION:The HARMONY GUYS are a four-piece vocal/instrumental band who p
 erform four-part harmony songs\, creating a wonderful blend of vocal sound
 s for all genres. Having individually performed in shows with the likes of
  The Delltones\, Ted Mulray Gang and The Cliff Richard Experience\, this c
 ombination of talented musicians delivers a performance of unforgettable e
 xcellence. With an expansive repertoire of songs from the 60’s\, 70’s 
 and 80’s they also perform favourite hits from The Beach Boys\, The Holl
 ies\, Cliff Richard & The Shadows\, The Mavericks\, The Eagles\, The Beatl
 es\, ELO and many more. The ever-popular Gold Coast based HARMONY GUYS are
  undoubtedly the most enjoyable and unique band in the entertainment scene
 .
